		<!-- The vampire's BLOOD POOL on the Main (user 2026-10-01, SPEC I189d, V532): the same block
		     as the Vampire tab's - the same fifty fields, the same 26 x 30 step, the same faded twin
		     above the generation's pool, painted by renderVampCaps - in the band under SKILLS, between
		     VIRTUES and HEALTH. It closes where HEALTH closes at SEVEN levels, the avatar's line
		     (SPEC V415): 541 + 7 * 27 + 55 = 785, so the box is 244 tall and the 259 x 145 grid sits
		     CENTRED under the title (first row at 67, a 32 foot). Hidden unless the game is Vampire
		     (renderGameMode, SPEC Q108.3). Since the 47th batch the XML spot is the MORTAL sheet's,
		     shared with ROAD and never seen; a vampire's Main moves the box to VAMP_GEOM, still
		     closing on the seven-level line (SPEC I190c, V534c). dynBloodTurnMain is the faded
		     "Blood per Turn X" between title and dots, written by renderVampCaps (SPEC I190h). Names carry m where the tab's carry v: the imports are
		     pasted into one constructor, so a repeated name would be one self.<name> (SPEC V530e). -->
